                        </div>
                        <div class="col-lg-6">
                            <h2 class="section-title">Corporate Governance Advisory Services in Ahmedabad</h2>
                            <p>Good governance is not limited to fulfilling statutory requirements. It influences how a company is directed, how responsibilities are defined, how decisions are documented and how stakeholders can place confidence in the organisation.</p>
                            <p>As a professional corporate governance advisory firm, Sonagra &amp; Company helps businesses assess their existing governance practices and address areas that require greater structure, oversight or regulatory attention.</p>
