                <div class="service-detail-points">
                    <h3>Strengthen Your Corporate Governance Framework</h3>
                    <p>Strong governance creates greater clarity around responsibilities, decision-making and compliance while helping businesses build long-term stakeholder confidence. Whether you need assistance with board and committee matters, governance policies, secretarial compliance, regulatory reviews or reporting, our team can provide practical guidance tailored to your organisation.</p>
